   "sentenceId": 12,
   "he": "רַבִּי יְהוּדָה אוֹמֵר: אִם הָיְתָה וְכוּ׳. כַּמָּה מִדָּה מְרוּבָּה? אָמַר רַבָּה בַּר בַּר חָנָה אָמַר רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן: עֲשָׂרָה כּוֹרִין. תַּנְיָא נָמֵי הָכִי: כַּמָּה מִדָּה מְרוּבָּה? עֲשָׂרָה כּוֹרִין.",
   "en": "The mishna teaches that «Rabbi Yehuda says: If» the deposit «was» a large measure, the bailee does not deduct the decrease from it. The Gemara asks: «How much is a large measure? Rabba bar bar Ḥana says» that «Rabbi Yoḥanan says:» It is «ten kor. This is also taught» in a baraita: «How much is a large measure?» It is «ten kor.»"
  }
